Read count from input ASCII digit then output tick/tock alternating that many times
Tape layout: count counter value

,------------------------------------------------
[
  t: >++++++++++[>+++++++++++<-]>++++++.  [-]<[-]<
  i: >++++++++++[>+++++++++++<-]>-----.   [-]<[-]<
  c: >++++++++++[>++++++++++<-]>-.        [-]<[-]<
  k: >++++++++++[>+++++++++++<-]>---.     [-]<[-]<
  nl: >++++++++++.                        [-]<
  t: >++++++++++[>+++++++++++<-]>++++++.  [-]<[-]<
  o: >++++++++++[>+++++++++++<-]>+.       [-]<[-]<
  c: >++++++++++[>++++++++++<-]>-.        [-]<[-]<
  k: >++++++++++[>+++++++++++<-]>---.     [-]<[-]<
  nl: >++++++++++.                        [-]<
  -
]
